  "description": "After finishing his residency, Seol-Won opens an eye clinic in his hometown and plans a getaway at his friend's mountain villa to celebrate. Because his friends are running late, he ends up spending the night alone... and hears someone enter the premises. Thankfully, it's just Hae-Joo, his friend's mysterious brother who came to get something from the villa. But when a massive blizzard traps the two of them inside the villa, Seol-Won can't help feeling self-conscious around the alpha who looks intimidating but seems kind. Will the unlikely pair get to know each other before the snow lets up?\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
